text: "# The CLICK framework — turn rented reach into owned audience\n\nA platform rents you attention and can change the rules tomorrow. CLICK converts that rented reach into\nan **audience you own** (email/SMS/community) and into outcomes — without wasting the most valuable real\nestate you have. The agent designs it; WoopSocial publishes the driving posts; the hub/landing/email\ntools are external.\n\n## C — Capture an owned audience\n- The real goal isn't \"traffic\" — it's an **owned list** that survives algorithm shifts. Lead with a\n  **value-first capture** (lead magnet → email) **before** any ask to buy.\n- Anchor the primary action to the **conversion goal** (`goals-and-kpis`).\n\n## L — Lead to ONE clear action\n- **Focus beats variety.** Kill the homepage and the link-graveyard. One clear next step (or a tight,\n  *prioritized* hub) the visitor can take in seconds.\n- Match it to the **intent of the content** that drove the click — not a generic catch-all.\n\n## I — Intent-match the destination per platform\n- **Instagram** → lead magnet + email capture (value clear on screen one). **X** → one specific\n  destination, punchy, no funnel smell. **YouTube** → more substance. **LinkedIn** → booking / lead\n  capture (high-value prospects).\n\n## C — Carry the link correctly per platform\n- Respect **link suppression**: **X / LinkedIn / Facebook → first comment**; **IG / TikTok → bio +\n  Stories sticker + verbal CTA**; **Pinterest → link-out**; **YouTube → description + pinned comment**.\n- (Mechanics: `x-growth`, `facebook-strategy`, `linkedin-growth`, `pinterest-growth`, `story-writer`.)\n\n## K — Keep it tracked + fresh\n- **Branded short link + UTM + GA4** for attribution (which post/video converts). **A/B test** the\n  highest-traffic hub. **Rotate weekly, audit monthly** (dead links kill trust). **Never fabricate** a\n  click or conversion.\n\n## The traffic brief a request should fill\n```\nOWNED GOAL: the list/outcome to grow (email/SMS/community), tied to a KPI\nPRIMARY ACTION: the ONE next step + the lead magnet (capture before sell)\nDESTINATION: intent-matched page per platform (not the homepage)\nPLACEMENT: per platform (first comment vs bio vs link-out vs description)\nTRACKING: branded short link + UTM scheme + GA4; one A/B test running\nFRESHNESS: weekly rotation + monthly audit; conversions read from the link tool/GA4 (never fabricated)\n```\n"
